\tau
=\sqrt{\frac{3\rho}{2p_0}}
\int_0^{a_0}
\frac{da}{\sqrt{a_0^3/a^3-1}}
}.
$$
Equivalently, scaling $a=a_0x$ gives
$$
\tau
=a_0\sqrt{\frac{3\rho}{2p_0}}
\int_0^1\frac{x^{3/2}}{\sqrt{1-x^3}}\,dx.
$$

